    <string name="health_connect_rationale_title">RunPro and Health Connect</string>
    <string name="health_connect_rationale_body">RunPro exports finished runs synced from your watch into Health Connect so apps such as Samsung Health can display them.\n\nRunPro requests write-only access for:\n• Running exercise sessions and laps\n• GPS exercise routes\n• Heart rate series\n• Distance\n• Steps\n\nRunPro does not read health data written by other apps.</string>
